                                                                    "left": {
                                                                      "raw_text": "Participation in a HA support group or other activity such as meditation or yoga intended to mitigate HA or other chronic pain must be stable at least 4 weeks prior to beginning the initial screen (P1) visit and may not be started during the study"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "right": {
